OL,3,GNEWSAJobless feel 'ignored' decades
OL,4,Aafter Jarrow March
OL,5,
OL,6,FNinety years ago, 200 unemployed men
OL,7,Ffrom Jarrow in South Tyneside set off
OL,8,Fon an almost month-long march to
OL,9,FWestminster pleading for jobs after the
OL,10,Flocal shipyard closed. It proved
OL,11,Ffruitless. Now, there is a new national
OL,12,Fcrusade, to try to find a future for
OL,13,Fthe nearly one million young people not
OL,14,Fin education, employment or training.
OL,16,F"I wouldn't even mind if I got like a
OL,17,Frejection email, at least that way I
OL,18,Fknow that something's wrong," says
OL,19,F19-year-old Keir Gulia.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
