OL,3,GNEWSAJobless feel 'ignored' decades
OL,4,Aafter Jarrow March
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter completing a Level 2
OL,7,Fqualification in light vehicle repair
OL,8,Fand maintenance, he hopes to become a
OL,9,Fmechanic.
OL,11,FBut he says he feels "ignored" by
OL,12,Femployers, having received no responses
OL,13,Ffrom several apprenticeships he has
OL,14,Fapplied for.
